    // Performance-oriented schedule
    // --------------------------------------------------------------------
    //
    // Data layout recap:
    //   A(p, q, r): p is the innermost (stride-1) dimension.
    //   C4(p, s):   p is innermost; for fixed s, C4(p, s) is contiguous.
