    // but for each (r,q) it walks C4 with a large stride in memory
    // (varying s with fixed p).
    //
    // We want to:
    //   - Keep the summation order over s the same (to preserve
    //     floating-point accumulation order).
    //   - Make p the innermost loop, so we can:
    //       * vectorize across p (contiguous memory),
    //       * for each s, stream a vector of C4(p, s) contiguously.
